WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
Manon dashes while Dee Jay falls from heavy Rond-point.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:00.760
Manon uses raw Drive Rush to approach with standing light punch.

3
00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:00.920
Manon checks Dee Jay’s wake-up with standing light punch.

4
00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:02.970
Dee Jay activates his Level 2 Super Art after Manon’s Rush jab.

5
00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:04.200
Manon blocks Dee Jay’s Level 2 Super Art.

6
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:04.350
The super has been guarded and both characters recover.
